<amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1601391184"/></metadata></head><body dur="3:47.673"><div begin="1.072" end="13.843"><p begin="1.072" end="3.814" itunes:key="L1" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1.072" end="1.624">鉄の</span><span begin="1.624" end="2.424">弾が</span> <span begin="2.424" end="3.090">正义の</span><span begin="3.090" end="3.814">证明</span></p><p begin="3.824" end="6.483" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3.824" end="4.691">贯けば</span> <span begin="4.798" end="5.616">英雄に</span><span begin="5.616" end="6.483">近づいた</span></p><p begin="6.483" end="9.027" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="6.483" end="7.211">その目を</span><span begin="7.211" end="7.809">闭じて</span> <span begin="7.809" end="8.479">触れてみ</span><span begin="8.479" end="9.027">れば</span></p><p begin="9.137" end="13.843" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="9.137" end="9.644">同じ</span><span begin="9.644" end="10.177">形</span> <span begin="10.177" end="10.777">同じ</span><span begin="10.777" end="11.961">体温の悪</span><span begin="11.961" end="13.843">魔</span></p></div><div begin="14.479" end="26.293"><p begin="14.479" end="17.038" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="14.479" end="15.442">仆はダメ</span><span begin="15.442" end="15.791">で</span> <span begin="15.791" end="16.740">あいつはいい</span><span begin="16.740" end="17.038">の？</span></p><p begin="17.148" end="19.833" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="17.148" end="17.612">そこに</span><span begin="17.612" end="18.491">壁が</span><span begin="18.491" end="19.833">あっただけなのに</span></p><p begin="19.843" end="22.459" itunes:key="L7" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="19.843" end="20.451">生まれて</span><span begin="20.451" end="21.150">しまった</span> <span begin="21.150" end="21.616">运命</span><span begin="21.616" end="22.459">叹くな</span></p><p begin="22.469" end="26.293" itunes:key="L8" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="22.469" end="22.960">仆ら</span><span begin="22.960" end="23.810">はみんな</span> <span begin="23.810" end="24.504">自由</span><span begin="24.504" e